notes.content:
We apologize to the players for any inconvenience caused on the release of the project.

And today, with the first patch, we hurried to fix the following bugs and errors:

1. It is forbidden to buy a cheaper house or car if there is a more expensive model available;
2. Prohibited the purchase of the house/car/clothes, if such is already available;
3. Fixed some descriptions in the tooltips in the popup window;
4. Fixed a bug with the accrual of a new level every time you enter the game;
5. Fixed a bug with the work, when you have complied with all the requirements, but to start working still could not for unknown reasons.


And also made some innovations:

1. The game is fully translated into English;
2. There is a button "Freeze time" under the clock at the bottom of the screen (similar to pause, but you can view all sections of the game to build further promotion tactics);
3. Added random events to work as a taxi driver;
4. The required Level for starting a business has been increased (from 35 to 40);
5. A modified conservation system. Previously, the game itself was saved only when you exit the game, as well as manually by clicking the save progress button under the clock, so that players were calm. However, now these two systems have been added to automatically save progress every 10 minutes.

Due to all the bugs, we had to reset all player saves, and now the game needs to start over to fully enjoy it. More such global discharges are not expected. However, we did not touch the accumulated points in the leaderboard and achievements.

At the moment, all known issues are fixed, thank you for your feedback! We will continue to improve the project and fill it with content to make it interesting for you to spend time. We expect 2 more major updates ahead, which we will try to release every week.
